        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ee2af034-8ebe-43f8-a8f3-525e060dbb31).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rFIA President Max Rutter allegedly hired a race marshal to sabotage driver Kowoon’s monoplaza with an explosive device. Meanwhile, the press chiefs continue to criticize the racing driver’s recent performances. Our client has specifically requested the elimination of Rutter, the marshal, and the press chiefs responsible. Summer Turner is of particular interest. Five targets, one contract. \r\rGood luck, 47.",
